100 100                Swidth(m), Slength(m)
     3 2.1012E-04       nbcroff, bcropeak(m3/s)
     0 0.0
 16180 2.1012E-04
 43200 0.0                (12 * 3600s)
------------------------------------------------------------------
 SWIDTH      Source area width (m), =
 SLENGTH     Source area flow path length (m), , std. = 100m (30m for pond)
 NBCROFF     (integer) number of time steps of the incoming field hydrograph Default
                            2 = rectangle; 3 = triangle
 BCROPEAK    peak flow of the incoming field hydrograph (m3/s)
 BCROFF(I,J) incoming field hydrograph: flow rate, time (s) vs. qin(m3/s).
 
** Rectangle  12h**
100 100                Swidth(m), Slength(m)
     2 1.0506E-04       nbcroff, bcropeak(m3/s)
     0 1.0506E-04
 43200 1.0506E-04                (12 * 3600s)
------------------------------------------------------------------
 BCROPEAK(m3/s) = Peak Runoff rate = [RunoffVolume (mm/h) * (1 m/1000mm) * (1h/3600 sec)] * [A(ha) * (10000 m2/ha)]
 BCROPEAK(m3/s) = RunoffVolume(mm/h) * A(ha) / 360
 Tb             = End time (s) = Duration * 3600

 ** Triangle 12 h**
100 100                Swidth(m), Slength(m)
     3 2.1012E-04       nbcroff, bcropeak(m3/s)
     0 0.0
 16180 2.1012E-04
 43200 0.0                (12 * 3600s)
------------------------------------------------------------------
 BCROPEAK_Rectangle(m3/s) * 2
 Tp             = Tb_Rectangle / 2.67
